From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:58:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(kanban): stamp run_machine on session-kanban-tasks rows
 [daveey]

The Desktop linked-card strip shows whether a running or waiting card runs on
the hub or a worker. Each listed card (local board and replica) gets
run_machine: the lease holder while running or assigned, a single
machine:<m> pin, worker-pool for worker-first-v1 cards, else created_on.
